  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sri.Laxmikant M. Shindhe vs The Deputy Commissioner on 27 May, 2019 Author: S G Pandit Bench: S.G. Pandit In The High Court Of Karnataka, Dharwad Bench Dated This The 27 T H Day Of May 2019 Before The Hon'Ble Mr.Justice S.G. Pandit W.P.No.106391/2019 (Gm-Res) Between: Sri Laxmikant M.Shindhe, Age: 30 Years, Occ: The Proprietor Shindhe Trader, Adaragunchi, R/O: Cts No.2/1, Hugar Plot, Islampur Road, Behind Jarathaghar Mill, Bankapur Chouk, Hubli. Dist: Dharwad. ...Petitioner (By Sri. C.R. Hiremath, Adv.) And: 1. The Deputy Commissioner Dharwad. 2. The Office Of Karnataka Joint Director, Department Of Food Civil Supply And Consumer Affairs Office At Deputy Commission'S Premises Dharwad-01. 3. The Designated Officer Food Safety And Standard Act, Kims Premises, Near Maruti Mandir, Hubballi, Dist: Dharwad. 2 Sri.Laxmikant M. Shindhe vs The Deputy Commissioner on 27 May, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/118612891/ 1 4. Food Safety Officer Hubballi Taluk, Code No.0777 Dist: Dharwad. ...Respondents (By Sri. Ravi V.Hosmani, Aga) This Writ Petition Is Filed Under Articles 226 And 227 Of The Constitution Of India Praying To Issue A Writ Of Certiorari Or Any Other Writ To Quash The Order Of Seizure Issued By The Respondent No.4 In Form Iii Dated 21.01.2019 In Respect Of Items Mentioned At Serial No.2 To 16 Only The Copy Of The Same Is Produced Herewith At Annexure-A And Etc.",
